  "details": "Description\n\nOnly when I log in on PCVR, my profile picture resets to show my avatar picture. I do not have VRC+, but I have an ingame picture set as my pfp. It usually works fine; changing worlds, avatars, or logging in on browser doesnt seem to change it. But every time I open PCVR, it gets reset.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nAfaik; have an ingame image set as your pfp, close the game, and reopen in pcvr. (I have not personally tested PCScreen or Quest, but it would be odd if they did not act the same as PCVR.)\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
